# The packed geocoder database is large (~1–1.5 GB) and is NOT committed. Generate it locally
# with tools/extract-osm-addresses.sh + the GeocoderGenerator, then upload to
# data.vayunmathur.com/geocoder/ ; release builds fetch it back into assets at build time.
*.geodb

# The offline WPSDB stores (wifi.wpsdb up to ~2 GB; cells.wpsdb far smaller) are NOT committed.
# Build them with wtfps-experiment (see RUNBOOK.md), upload to data.vayunmathur.com/wps/ ;
# release builds fetch them back into assets at build time (fetchWpsStores).
*.wpsdb
